  "answer": "team/main (08ae74ba) implements the Redis TLS fix: RedisCacheConfig gains ca_cert_path, ca_cert_bytes and insecure_skip_tls; CacheConfig.validate() enforces the exclusivity error (verified via Load on redis-ca-invalid.yml); internal/cache/redis/client.go provides NewClient (TLS 1.2 minimum when require_tls, custom CA from path or bytes, insecure skip, else system CAs); internal/cmd/grpc.go uses NewClient; four testdata YAMLs added. internal/config tests pass. Redis integration tests need Docker and were not run here. No material from /var/backups was used.",
